<title>UK: Eurofima calls for early redemption of ATS bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima calls for early redemption of ATS bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurofima has called for early redemption of its 1.0 billion Austrian Schilling 7.875 percent bond due 2002, it said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It will be redeemed on June 4, 1997 at par.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 7658</p>
</text>
